{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setReverseProxy:headers:","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","title":"setReverseProxy:headers:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"setReverseProxy:headers:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setReverseProxy:headers:","kind":"identifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets a reverse proxy URL and optional custom HTTP headers for all SDK network requests.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setReverseProxy:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"url","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"headers:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSDictionary<NSString *,NSString *>","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSDictionary"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"headers","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"url","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The full URL of your reverse proxy endpoint (e.g., “https:\/\/proxy.company.com\/pushwoosh”). Must not be nil or empty.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"headers","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional dictionary of custom HTTP headers. Pass nil if no custom headers are needed."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Routes all Pushwoosh SDK network requests through your own proxy server."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is useful for:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Enterprise security","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Route traffic through corporate proxies"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Regional compliance","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Ensure data flows through specific regions"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Network monitoring"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Inspect and log SDK traffic"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Firewall restrictions"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Work around corporate firewall rules"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The proxy must forward requests to the appropriate Pushwoosh API endpoints"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while preserving all headers and request body content."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Settings are not persisted and must be set on every app start.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"URL must start with https:\/\/ or http:\/\/."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom headers are only applied when reverse proxy is active."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","text":"Example","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure proxy for enterprise deployment:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class NetworkConfiguration {","","    func configureForEnterprise() {","        guard let proxyURL = Configuration.shared.pushwooshProxyURL else {","            return","        }","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setReverseProxy(proxyURL, headers: nil)","","        Logger.info(\"Pushwoosh configured to use proxy: \\(proxyURL)\")","    }","","    func configureForRegion(_ region: Region) {","        switch region {","        case .eu:","            Pushwoosh.configure.setReverseProxy(","                \"https:\/\/eu-proxy.company.com\/pushwoosh\",","                headers: [\"X-Auth-Token\": \"your-token\"]","            )","        case .asia:","            Pushwoosh.configure.setReverseProxy(","                \"https:\/\/asia-proxy.company.com\/pushwoosh\",","                headers: nil","            )","        case .us:","            break \/\/ No proxy needed","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setReverseProxy:headers:"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setreverseproxy:headers:"]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"role":"symbol","title":"PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"title":"PushwooshCore","abstract":[{"text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setReverseProxy:headers:":{"role":"symbol","t